  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:399px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/WNBC.jpg\" title=\"WNBC.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"540\" src=\"/images/WNBC.jpg\" width=\"397\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/WNBC.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><b>The Widower's Nest Base Camp can be accessed through a portal from <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a> Level 5 or a one way portal from <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Lair of the Vergrim</a>.  A portal leads out to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a> Level 1.  There is also an Obelisk which will allow you to return once you use it.</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h2>\n<p>This is another camp that has a <a href=\"/wiki/Ghostly_Guard\" title=\"Ghostly Guard\">Ghostly Guard</a> who seems to fill no function.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
